                                                        <p class="brfprofile" style="text-align: justify;"><b>Brief
                                                                Profile:</b> Ph.D. from the Department of Statistics and
                                                            Operations Research, Kurukshetra University in Stochastic
                                                            Queuing Systems. The expertise lies in the area(s) of
                                                            statistics, operation research, queuing systems, data
                                                            analysis, and research methods. Possesses over 20 years of
                                                            experience in teaching, research, and consulting. Guiding
                                                            three Ph.D. candidates in the area of stochastic financial
                                                            models and priority queues. Currently holding the position
                                                            of Director GNIOT Institute of Management (GIMS). The
                                                            previous assignments include Dean Professional Outreach at
                                                            JIMS, Sec-5, Rohini, Deputy Director at FIIB, New Delhi,
                                                            Director Lloyd Business School and Dean PGDM IB/FPM at JIMS,
                                                            Rohini. He authors over 100 publications in journals of
                                                            international repute with high indexing such as SCI, Scopus,
                                                            WoS, etc. Delivered talks and presented his research work in
                                                            international and national conferences in India and overseas
                                                            conducted by institutions of international repute such as
                                                            IIM - A, IIM - I, IIM - S, Tsukuba University - Japan,
                                                            IRAMMT - USA, MMTI - Thailand, Tribhuvan University - Nepal.
                                                            Won many awards for his research work. Concluded consulting
                                                            projects in the area of data analysis and forecasting with
                                                            certain corporate. Expanding the domain of research in the
                                                            field of neural networks, data analytics, and transient
                                                            analysis.</p>
